{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18655","headline":"南磵中题 · 柳宗元","name":"南磵中题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋气集南磵，独游亭午时。\n廻风一萧瑟，林影久参差。\n始至若有得，稍深遂忘疲。\n羁禽响幽谷，寒藻舞沦漪。\n去国魂已远，怀人泪空垂。\n孤生易爲感，失路少所宜。\n索寞竟何事，徘徊秖自知。\n谁爲後来者，当与此心期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}